                <l xml:id="m-34dc5639-75ef-4c22-9717-a7c5f1efbe09" facs="#m-80120dbf-2afa-4dd9-8335-3ad0a531a510" label="text-like">3rd Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-86470722-5db3-46e9-a05e-8586df77ad30" facs="#m-c92b28c5-5d69-4c52-a5dd-0086157684f6" label="ambiguous">557</l><l xml:id="m-5a78aa88-a0d3-495c-82aa-417e552851c2" facs="#m-ef4dba27-c050-47bc-b925-b0a228dde272" label="lyrics-like">mé-cum, contra me est. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-2c0aae83-3255-4c2c-b515-6b785e655567" facs="#m-97513af0-2b0a-4fd8-8d17-17e461324b08" label="ambiguous">Eph. S. b.</l><l xml:id="m-b402d1bc-ead5-4377-b74a-5b95f3e4f2e9" facs="#m-17a8f635-bf6f-40cf-9d3c-59cf40a5a182" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-669fb00a-3b24-4a4f-a5f6-e16f5f154667" facs="#m-e2987d78-d537-4867-a426-27ce4d3051e8" label="lyrics-like">COC enim scitóte intelligéntes : t ] lórum sérvitus, * non habet haere¬</l><l xml:id="m-492d901e-1aa4-4556-b42a-0500a3b92fdc" facs="#m-f6120322-b7e3-4eab-a54b-31a940f78216" label="lyrics-like">It quod omnis fornicátor, aut im-l ditá̂tem in regno Christi et Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-b62a5716-0db2-4eba-9076-a7a595d93af7" facs="#m-13f417d2-184f-420c-a2f0-7b67a1c632d6" label="lyrics-like">múndus, aut avárus, quod est ido¬</l><l xml:id="m-f774b1af-4692-4955-b44a-5d7734f546fa" facs="#m-475bf15b-ea00-44ce-aadb-b4422b170a7f" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Scápulis súis. V. Scúto. D. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-e9e14005-69aa-4eea-95c3-d76b0ea79a68" facs="#m-dc551aa7-1617-4701-a84b-315645ab1776" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-faa6e419-105f-410d-b60c-b2fceddea77c" facs="#m-d8c14d5d-50f9-4807-95a7-c45d93ec2980" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-016ce5e9-c54f-44b0-be6e-c273d348de6b" facs="#m-69e2f7a0-2fe9-4aff-914f-a2c49faa786f" label="ambiguous">1.1</l><l xml:id="m-a587fe17-8a5a-4408-9b01-4af73bf49f78" facs="#m-bb6d1318-07eb-4029-ac96-f0682f398058" label="lyrics-like">UMimmúndus spi-ri-tus“ ex--erit ab hómine,</l><l xml:id="m-0430e3f2-4867-43b2-ab50-43e964c062ab" facs="#m-e122698f-9c07-45d7-be22-f9fc12141139" label="lyrics-like">ámbu-lat per ló-ca inaquó-sa, quaérens réqui-em, et non</l><l xml:id="m-7c7d8732-1d78-47d7-8a0d-921fa4f800cf" facs="#m-b14d0fce-a483-49d0-9293-8534599f98a8" label="ambiguous">invenit. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-735c719b-3011-4883-acd1-926debd15a95" facs="#m-621efd32-a584-43e0-8b2a-6babd87249ca" label="ambiguous">Eph. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-981893d1-00fa-4104-bcb4-d0f270fe4751" facs="#m-6d3359bc-a693-45b4-a77e-2c02eec02b83" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-d7a0d5a7-d708-42ed-a31b-b64333e3a1db" facs="#m-da3d8985-7818-4427-bf3b-91b61c02fb8b" label="lyrics-like">(Rátis enim aliquándo ténebrae :! enim lucis est in omni bonitáte, et</l><l xml:id="m-a666a839-0cdf-4ccb-8506-8a92809780b7" facs="#m-eecd7d86-1346-4afb-9114-59ccd28f8fb8" label="lyrics-like">justitia, et veritáte.</l><l xml:id="m-48a39720-3b40-41ea-9a54-783730d960d5" facs="#m-f5676fa3-df40-45ab-a866-3453fb5ca223" label="lyrics-like">U nunc autem lux in Dómino:t</l><l xml:id="m-6746b5d5-7ae2-4dd9-aee2-8b7ddad970f4" facs="#m-2061b598-d3af-44a8-98a1-3718bf7e67e1" label="lyrics-like">ut filii lucis ambuláte:“ fructus!</l><l xml:id="m-c593b5af-179e-4b61-b5f8-8f102c115b6b" facs="#m-a9f52407-d80a-4164-a3e7-3d8ef25390f7" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Scúto. V. Angelis súis. p. 218.</l><l xml:id="m-7d7e17e4-488c-4e91-9255-06e08882bdf1" facs="#m-b054297a-5096-476f-a6ea-15350429482c" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-09943e11-29a7-46cc-b723-7609dd6d352a" facs="#m-51908915-f61d-4591-9a8b-b8723f13c38d" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Sunday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-1a2fb408-7e72-4101-a273-54264615ff76" facs="#m-b1cf2a83-070d-4e3b-ac79-b75382f018cf" label="ambiguous">Eph. S.</l><l xml:id="m-c2826200-e0f9-45c0-8e87-9fbad5b0804f" facs="#m-cd8219e4-70cf-48af-8447-7140494d35cf" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-7ca34efd-2aec-4a02-ac51-b7d0cb02a666" facs="#m-73d46f14-7d26-42e0-bace-61db1ac8d20d" label="lyrics-like">TRatres: Estóte imitatóres Dei, diléxit nos, et trádidit semetípsum</l><l xml:id="m-31b4f3e3-6bd0-4a8e-9b9e-bde024e00501" facs="#m-87a6da29-2c2b-4286-8472-b672c7e3b177" label="ambiguous">I</l><l xml:id="m-0eb00046-c77b-4d82-a4d2-f1301a43cebb" facs="#m-6b96896e-b741-46da-93aa-74bde9b29aed" label="lyrics-like">sicut filii caríssimi:t et ambu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d83aadf-6942-4477-9bf6-e5aafce4761a" facs="#m-95893dac-a312-4da4-9eff-7d491449ba1b" label="lyrics-like">pro nobis, * oblatiónem et hóstiam</l><l xml:id="m-5c250fb9-4bb5-468a-a92c-42935ba6629c" facs="#m-dbf46f64-82e5-4957-852b-dcdef40ebeae" label="lyrics-like">láte in dilectióne, sicut et Christus! Deo in odórem suavitátis.</l><l xml:id="m-5e971482-dbb7-475a-8abb-624db9c0c067" facs="#m-011d953f-8522-4aff-a36e-51060c1186a1" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Audi benîgne Cónditor. p. 539. Y. Angelis súis.</l><l xml:id="m-2bbd4682-7047-43da-b7aa-2e10f8829107" facs="#m-ce2e4505-5f7a-493d-b97c-ff9da57262a7" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-43a185e5-5a4d-4956-b2f0-c88b29007feb" facs="#m-2b52185b-0306-464f-81a5-468fdd987dcd" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8. G</l><l xml:id="m-e964d3b9-a42f-470e-913d-0dbe8c789d77" facs="#m-f1ce2632-c2d4-43b8-84fe-3ce41b2df508" label="lyrics-like">Xtóllens “ quaédam mú-li-er vócem de túrba</l><l xml:id="m-e318e797-0191-42a7-84ad-2a1029905bda" facs="#m-38939f4e-d749-4e67-adb9-8d26b2c722d5" label="ambiguous">M</l></lg>
